<Slide
  notes={`（2:25–2:50）仿真三个数：载波 30.999 MHz、偏差万分之三；29 与 33 MHz 抑制 11 到 14 dB；解调 4.82 Vpp，比值 1.20，正是设计目标。但实物没焊，过载、匹配和 6 m 距离还不敢下结论。`}
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px 0 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
      仿真结论：三项达成，两项仍待实测
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DCDCDC', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 24, gap: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 695, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
<Image src='assets/fig_wave.png' style={{ width: 695, height: 400 }} />
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6B6B6B', letterSpacing: 1 }}>仿真关键结果</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 26 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>30.999 MHz</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>载波频率，相对偏差 0.003%</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 38 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>11.4~13.7 dB</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>29 / 33 MHz 邻近频道抑制量</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 38 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F4E79', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>4.82 Vpp</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>解调输出，V2/V1 = 1.20（目标 1.2）</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 22, borderTop: '1px solid #DCDCDC', paddingTop: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B6B6B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        以上为 Multisim / ngspice 仿真结果，非实物测量；20 mV 大信号过载、31 MHz 输入匹配与 6 m 无线距离尚未验证。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 10 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>31 MHz 模拟调幅无线方波传输系统　·　方案汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>06 / 07</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
